#. native-sha256: d09da8ba0c12182202dc07e2a7c1201d26aca4a8629b29be6c15621283e62927
#. default-sha256: 1d99300599afc1b4c4a707fb8fda7fe575ff12131f9c0bb889458850b19361f0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“The mansion sat in ruins in that era; not a soul resided "
"within.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫⟪k:43⟫⟪k:44⟫⟪k:45⟫⟪k:46⟫⟪k:47⟫⟪k:48⟫⟪k:49⟫"
"⟪k:50⟫⟪k:51⟫⟪k:52⟫⟪k:53⟫⟪k:54⟫⟪k:55⟫⟪k:56⟫⟪k:57⟫⟪k:58⟫⟪k:59⟫ ⟪k:60⟫ ⟪k:61⟫⟪k:62⟫⟪k:63⟫「その時代、"
"⟪k:64⟫屋敷は荒廃し、⟪k:65⟫住む者もおりませんでした」"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c32dff707a0a040d5276898605e119a8065f4694b598a4762542f4a6d9edaac
#. default-sha256: ca7519112da34e03e4a940d20b70f5719e2a102df8d37f6ab5d9f8f8941cb5f2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The grandeur of the house was lost to the ages. It was in perpetual decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫屋敷はかつての栄光を失い、⟪k:1⟫衰退を辿るばかりでございました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9faa90008a51d500a9fc99c8f6e7f68bd8d9c7f7725261f7803d5f92dc22d07e
#. default-sha256: 073142b8a408f0136a92456b62883180a3b68756022b9da725b4177d06a3ac88
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not a flower grew in the garden; dust and dirt blackened the plaster; cobwebs blanketed the "
"corridors; ivy shrouded the outer walls. It was not a pleasant sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫庭には一輪の薔薇もなく、⟪k:1⟫漆喰の壁は塵芥により黒ずみ、⟪k:2⟫廊下には蜘蛛の巣が、⟪k:3⟫外壁は"
"蔦という蔦に覆われ、⟪k:4⟫見るも無残。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09351c9454844f274d2f45431263da2c9d23f924fe477aa7c84f98a2faded1a5
#. default-sha256: d0448fc415108a330902c943832e58d4b6ae2ba4af768cb02ad0827fe316eb57
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As hard as I tried to fight it, I could not stop the mansion’s descent into disrepair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tわたくしがどれだけ手入れをしようとも、⟪k:1⟫屋敷の崩壊を止める術はございませ"
"ん。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c954dfb4a23f9dad8d4d955007bf142e1607cedd6051d9acca3b48524e8faa1
#. default-sha256: 117d500843961acae3eefaad3de00d167f9da63d738daa29074f81f20aaf6c32
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The depth of the previous owner’s grief—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps despair—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was far too "
"much."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t先代の主の嘆き、⟪k:1⟫あるいは絶望があまりにも強すぎたのでしょうか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbb74bfc9aabfac387ce094bf2c8d5d13b84e6381ed672f68c9a63e6a2419225
#. default-sha256: 61f487707c6c2d3fec373a233ab3771ab4fce2e3c90189142641fc673f20759d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After the beautiful, flaxen-haired family, people stayed away from the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫先代……、⟪k:1⟫そう、⟪k:2⟫亜麻色の髪を持つ美しい一家の後は、⟪k:3⟫誰も屋敷に寄りつかなかったので"
"すわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2d08c27652e4577d3cd75873d3e9a3c8235b33fd470d52652e83f607d4058f9
#. default-sha256: 65995d462438be1cd992889c7b0f6d50ae7081ae692848328daf925aaeeb9d7f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had no heirs, so their bloodline simply vanished into the depths of history."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あの方々たちも子孫を残さず、⟪k:1⟫歴史の波に消えてしまいましたの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39cc5a9e9278741b4fd1f7db2edc3b07ae96ba4a2067fd73102f9fe8d7307439
#. default-sha256: a8abde2b4856914af09f6f06957b3a032202811b28402c272ca0bd32405a8948
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had been about fifty years since the house last had a resident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫無人となってから五十年ほどでしょうか……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87ab4be5d6de7d18024f9d7d7e26b6cd157afccaf4c1e55ea550475ec9a11e27
#. default-sha256: 0861128f132ac5b414b874c73c6e0be51bc0156d1c9ef0dd65902020d6c45615
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The forlorn property appeared as though it had been abandoned for centuries, and the "
"occasional villager who stumbled upon it did not remain there for more than a day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫屋敷はまるで何世紀も捨てられたかのような有様で、⟪k:1⟫時折迷い込む村人も、⟪k:2⟫そのうらびれた"
"恐ろしさに一日と滞在しないのでした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53698e6cc4b4cb18f535cb2c080f93c5de92b881768efa793e0fd5943ba92a36
#. default-sha256: f84926cf183c392288a66bbf3d2917e65b6282a3f1cd0c0e47cc10ecf8a0aa61
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My time there was rather solitary. ⟪k:1⟫That was perhaps the loneliest time of my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫孤独でございましたわ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫この頃が、⟪k:4⟫一番寂しかったのではないでしょ"
"うか。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 563a6e25fa90a3fbf497f86590a2e2bb8447f38911186582c185b9ac47ed8593
#. default-sha256: 683da211d3bcf6ff478acf2af6727bcaf34f38b6e4279689563d6af9609052da
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Everyone who visited the mansion feared it, and it was left without anyone to become its "
"master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫訪れる者は全て屋敷を恐れ、⟪k:1⟫旦那さまとなるべき方は現れません。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaed7b120f8fc7aa4f86d0428a68b1d49722c30e725e360bb1459898879ee542
#. default-sha256: 7894a703700f0f3c5a2701729688be8aee6dbb0798f0d98cd7d94cd6e3b75383
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even came to believe that my time serving as a maid would come to an end in this era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫きっとわたくしの女中としての使命も、⟪k:1⟫この時代で終わり――そうまで思っていましたの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3db96800739bde7e8fdc8cbc203c636ff2a75c2fe37385ed2a95d85e161b56b4
#. default-sha256: 045ce05311679e2cfcfbe9eaa30b11db65c14528963415d52f03a82d7348df9a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, one day, I noticed something out of the ordinary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかしある日、⟪k:1⟫屋敷の異変に気が付きましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee204686a925951d539d32802a218c80acb67bf7a54771278b331e4207deb336
#. default-sha256: 9f4c456761f1cfe63f14b27c6d1d335248bb8b50cd64f2d390d2b8fe3a60d739
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a servant of the house, I am almost immediately aware of any new presence within its "
"walls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしはこの屋敷の女中ですから、⟪k:1⟫屋敷が抱える者の存在はすぐに気付きます。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfe870d182ecd8ea1817989aaff67b34e1f3af28da71e60a6e9acd3b4ff01b07
#. default-sha256: 92817d508da9426b11c610924f8b21989dd4175ca1235b9c40612f09c706047b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there appeared to be someone downstairs."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫どうやら、⟪k:2⟫階下に人がいるようなのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6c27f031e47479e772e6b8db52f64660271a7259801c2acf80ed17bb7085dae
#. default-sha256: b10f305d87590c95d3a6f79e0e67b1e8cabcc206736ad403249a76a51ed54f63
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Can you imagine just how delighted I was?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その時のわたくしの喜びといったら！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9678f60a445cfc98f0280b3ab22382cffab7321ec272494086a8e55475c0e79e
#. default-sha256: 3a71b19a6c39c298e0bff6ac9956b6330d410db520715239cbcfa7520e71638c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though part of me was anxious about what kind of person I might find, the "
"possibility that it could be you had my heart aflutter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫多少なりとも不安はありましたけれど、⟪k:3⟫もしかしたら旦那さまがいらっしゃったのかも"
"しれないと思い、"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fb2c279f6b8b7d946141c8723ee0c4c16eb7522057149d150a95468008691e8
#. default-sha256: 6da52b64b41e0004afc961eaa522622b31e8201fa0325e031beb777c6c7c4839
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, resisting the urge to rush, I headed for the basement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫はやる気持ちを抑えながら、⟪k:1⟫地下へと向かいましたの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bfcd1f5e7a2649d3973df2e49ae91bb1d6c38cc188377980877a48fd57009bf
#. default-sha256: 073c52b77327910bc1336ff91dd77df7bf43328949de888682afd774cd0464aa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where red wine, smoked meat, and other preserved foods were kept."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そこは貯蔵庫として利用していて、⟪k:1⟫赤ワインや燻製など、⟪k:2⟫日持ちする食品を詰め込んでおり"
"ました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 888bdd2460e094090686ac3dd1eb30341360130de0b6bb2524efbf96c1ae3394
#. default-sha256: c90d28f5071f83cb837e780579e3a7f4a47b84a520e0ea31fc82db893f4c99b5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By that point, the wine was practically antique."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ワインなんて、⟪k:1⟫もう年代物も良いところですわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8f988a7e78b233b11c66b85c614bd7753e1c702f763c1cd7367051af57e8274
#. default-sha256: 01fbf375cae67cb39a9b68bbe76c46dc70bc328c5b961e162a3f087562d20328
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I had expected, a man had made his way into the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫扉の奥には、⟪k:2⟫案の定、⟪k:3⟫何者かが入り込んでおりました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78bd034461a01629c9aca5d5a1b8691afbf021dec878e9b7231a33fde18d5973
#. default-sha256: 00a779496801f0107f94f8d1313b3ce7af27824695c1f56825663ec234fe9aeb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Is anyone there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫\tそこに、⟪k:3⟫どなたかいらっしゃるんですの？ "

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5a40fc745ecc4b59f0321956cb15abe2e9a19fd9f5b6d05fa23eb9e8aeeeb1d
#. default-sha256: 8369928f47b7b70a34bb8e9941b8f670168376573806058b003f7ff318960842
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although, I am unsure if referring to him as a “man” is entirely accurate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし……“彼”を人と称するのは正しかったのでしょうか？ \t"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A93706E_89F4_4CA8_9521_8C4E07974C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31610e1286734f6916c930337c7e5472f0d9d8c4478ef064de15ccdaecdf1103
#. default-sha256: 50cad06f8632c7afa9f75117bf3c2eaf59856a99184d7efed40ff3aef15dca57
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3A93706E_89F4_4CA8_9521_8C4E07974C4C"
